            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekia ali ne myaka yakufyalwa amakumi yabili na umo (21) ilyo atendeke ukuteeka pa bufumu, kabili aikele pa bufumu imyaka ikumi limo na umo (11) mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acitile ifyabipa pa cinso cakwa Yawe, Lesa wakwe, kabili afililwe no kuicefya kuli Yeremia kasesema, uwalandile icebo cakwa Yawe kuli ena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili asangukila imfumu Nebukadinesa uwamusontele pa bufumu no kumulenga ukulapa mwishina lyakwa Lesa. Elyo akosha umutima no kutalama icakuti afilwa no kubwelela kuli Yawe, Lesa wa bena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili abakalamba bonse aba bashimapepo na bantu bene bacishamo ukuba ababula icishinka, mukukonka imicitile iyabipisha iya mishobo ya benafyalo elyo no kukowesha ŋanda yakwa Yawe iyali iyashishiwa mu Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
