            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe, Lesa wa fikolwe fyabo, akonkanyapofye ukubatumina amashiwi ayalelanda inkombe shakwe, pantu alikwatile abantu elyo ne ncende yakwe uluse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo baletumfya inkombe shakwa Lesa, ukususha amashiwi yakwe no kuseka bakasesema bakwe mpaka Yawe afulilwa abantu bakwe, ukufulwa ukushili kwakubwesha umutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lesa epakubemisha imfumu ya bena Kaludea",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abena Kaludea:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mutundu wa bantu abaikele ku calo ca ku kulyo lubali lwa ku musumba wa Babiloni. E mutundu wa ba lupwa lwakwa Nebukadinesa uwaishile teeka ku Babiloni (Esra 5:12).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " uwaishile ipaya abalumendo bonse ku lupanga abali mu cifulo camushilo, kabili tashilepo nangu umo umulumendo nangu umukashana, umwaume umukalamba nangu umukote. Lesa apeelefye bonse mu minwe yakwa Nebukadinesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asenda ifipe fyonse ifya mu ŋanda yakwa Lesa ku Babiloni, ifikulu ne finono. Elyo asenda ne cuma conse ica mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe pamo ne cuma ca mfumu na bacilolo bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baoca Iŋanda yakwa Lesa, babongolola ne linga lya ku musumba wa Yerusalemu. Baoca na mayanda yonse aye sano elyo no konaula icipe conse ica mulimo uukankala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
