            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cali mu mwaka wakutendeka uwakuba pa bufumu bwakwa Sairasi imfumu ya ku Pesia, pakufikilisha ishiwi lyakwa Yawe ilyasosele kasesema Yeremia, Yawe aimishe umutima wakwa Sairasi imfumu ya ku Pesia ukuma imbila mu bufumu bwakwe no kuilemba ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.44.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esaya 44:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ifi efyo Sairasi imfumu ya ku Pesia yasosa, ‘Yawe, Lesa uwaba mu mulu nampeela ifyalo fya shamfumu fyonse ifya pano isonde kabili nine asontele ukumukuulila iŋanda mu Yerusalemu iyaba mu Yuda. Na bonse abakwa Yawe pali imwe mwe bali pano, kuti mwabwelela ku Yuda mukuya bomba uyu mulimo, na Yawe Lesa wenu abe na imwe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
          }
